n illustrious career. In November 1999, I flew to Moscow to cover Leeds Uni=
ted=E2=80=99s Uefa Cup tie with Spartak, only for it to be postponed becaus=
e the undersoil heating failed in temperatures of -15C. Perhaps Leeds is th=
e common denominator here?</span></span></p></div></div></td></tr></table><=
