s national heats, culminating in a 100m race at half-time of the Wembley fi=
nal.<br><br>
A few days before the final, a friend who was playing for Swansea City call=
ed with a tip, saying winger John Williams =E2=80=94 known as =E2=80=9CThe =
Flying Postman=E2=80=9D from a previous job =E2=80=94 was a hot favourite. =
So much so, that Swansea were resting him from their league game the day be=
fore and the entire players=E2=80=99 pool was being bet on him to win.<br><=
br>
